{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1520544001:1":{"text":"스승님, 정말로... 돌아오셨군요. 마법사들이 허세를 부리는 거라고 생각했는데...","source_cn":"老师，你真的……真的回来了。我原本以为那个魔法师是在故...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D3B3B5E4FF4518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520544002:1":{"text":"샤프아이, 왜 그렇게 생각한 것이냐.","source_cn":"你为什么会这么认为，锐眼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61DD8BA3CB92A42B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520544003:1":{"text":"저들은 보칼리스에서 왔으니까요! 음흉하고 교활한 보칼리스는 아쿠보르의 적이니까요.","source_cn":"因为他从呼临来！他们阴毒、狡诈，呼临是雅库伯尔的敌人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F037C468D65340D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520544004:1":{"text":"얘야, 네가 틀렸단다...","source_cn":"我的孩子，你错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE17DF8262650C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520544005:1":{"text":"아뇨. 보칼리스인이 스승님을 죽였잖아요!","source_cn":"我没错，是呼临人杀了你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14E4D25F8E2380E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520544006:1":{"text":"스승님이 저 대신 공격을 막아주지 않으셨다면 아직 살아계셨을 거예요. 그러니 제가 복수해 드릴게요. 때를 기다렸다가 놈들의 목을 물어뜯으면...!","source_cn":"你本不该死的，如果不是要为我挡下攻击，你就还会活着！我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B69C0A4C1A3280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520544007:1":{"text":"얘야... 나를 죽인 건 보칼리스인이 아니었어. 내 목을 물어뜯은 건 아쿠보르의 달이 소환한 짐승 무리였단다.","source_cn":"孩子……呼临人那一枪并没有杀死我，我是被雅库伯尔之月召...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6ECE543CC7F61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520544008:1":{"text":"...알아요. 하지만...","source_cn":"……我知道，可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5366C50ED98FC368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520544009:1":{"text":"스승님, 정말 보고 싶었어요.","source_cn":"老师……我想念你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAF846726C66D00B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520544010:1":{"text":"우리 모두 그렇지.","source_cn":"我们都是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D0AC26E1CCC028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士锐眼":{"text":"전사 샤프아이","source":"战士锐